usage
=====

BIOS:

  cp /usr/share/limine/limine-bios.sys /boot/
  limine bios-install /dev/sdX

UEFI (EFI system partition mounted on /boot):

  mkdir -p /boot/EFI/BOOT
  cp /usr/share/limine/BOOTX64.EFI /boot/EFI/BOOT/

create /boot/limine.conf:

  timeout: 5

  /Alice Linux
      protocol: linux
      kernel_path: boot():/vmlinuz-linux
      module_path: boot():/initrd-linux
      cmdline: root=/dev/sda2 rw loglevel=3 quiet

on upgrade, the postinstall script automatically updates installed limine
EFI binaries (on /boot or /efi) and limine-bios.sys, and reruns
`limine bios-install` on MBR disks. GPT disks need bios-install rerun manually.

see also: https://alicelinux.org/docs/bootloader.html
